    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "Adds a deterministic, read-only context-packet request and response for one immutable repository snapshot. A packet combines a declared context closure with required and optional selected-content members under explicit byte and item budgets, records every omission and warning, binds continuation to the request and snapshot, and carries a canonical packet digest without creating cross-repository authority.\n",
